=== BUG-041 witness ===

Transcript of the directed run on the audited RTL (proof/logs/sim.log):

case=control_serial_byte_is_received_and_readable PASS rdata=5a expected=5a
case=control_second_byte_reads_back_as_itself PASS rdata=c3 expected=c3
case=control_status_reports_rxempty_after_drain PASS status=0000003c rxempty=1
TBFAIL case=violating_rdata_after_documented_rxrst_must_not_return_payload rdata=5a received_earlier=5a rxempty=1
TBFAIL case=violating_residual_must_not_persist_across_repeated_empty_reads rdata=5a rxempty=1
TBFAIL case=violating_block_reset_must_clear_received_payload rdata=5a after rst_ni rxempty=1
case=control_new_traffic_displaces_the_residual PASS rdata=96 expected=96
cov_byte_a=1 cov_byte_b=1 cov_status_empty=1 cov_residual=1 cov_displaced=1
witness_hits=1
